/Diamond { stroke [] 0 setdash vpt add moveto
  hpt neg vpt neg rlineto  hpt vpt neg rlineto
  hpt vpt rlineto  hpt neg vpt rlineto  closepath } def
/Box { stroke [] 0 setdash
  /vpt1 vpt  0.8 mul def /hpt1 hpt  0.8 mul def
